[1m═══ Function: [36mlen ═══[0m

[33mDescription:[0m Returns the length of a list, string, or tuple
[33mCategory:   [0m Collection
[33mSyntax:     [0m [36mlen(collection)[0m
[33mReturns:    [0m [32mInt[0m

[1mParameters:[0m
